d3 x1o168i8 xhslqc4 xlyipyv xj0a0fe x126k92a x1h7i4cw x1ua5tub" dir="ltr" role="button"><span data-testid="selectable-text" dir="auto" class="quoted-mention xnpuxes selectable-text copyable-text" style="min-height: 0px;">Bom dia!!  O cuidado precoce limita os danos !! Foi ótima essa parceria!!</span></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="x1n2onr6 x1mzt3pk x126k92a x6ikm8r x10wlt62"><span data-testid="selectable-text" dir="ltr" class="x1f6kntn xjb2p0i x8r4c90 xo1l8bm x1ic7a3i x12xpedu xnpuxes selectable-text copyable-text" style="min-height: 0px;"><span class="">Sim, estou entrando em contato com o responsável pelo SAME, para verificar qual o protocolo, que devemos ter para a nossa segurança e dos demais, que não se encontram infectados, estou aguardando a resposta dele.</span></span><span class=""><span class="x3nfvp2 xxymvpz xlshs6z xqtp20y xexx8yu x1uc92m x18d9i69 x181vq82 x12lo8hy x152skdk" aria-hidden="true"><span class="x1c4vz4f x2lah0s xn6xy2s"></span><span class="x1c4vz4f x2lah0s">09:28</span></span></span></div></div><div class="x1n2onr6 x1n327nk x18mqm2i xhsvlbd x14z9mp xz62fqu x1wbi8v6"><div class="x1bvqhpb xx3o462 xuxw1ft x78zum5 x6s0dn4 x12lo8hy x152skdk" data-testid="msg-meta" role="button"><span class="x1rg5ohu x16dsc37" dir="auto"><span class="x193iq5w xeuugli x13faqbe x1vvkbs xt0psk2 x1fj9vlw xhslqc4 x1hx0egp x1pg5gke xjb2p0i xo1l8bm xl2ypbo x1ic7a3i" style="--x-fontSize: 12px; --x-lineHeight: 8.5313px;">09:28</span></span><div class="xhslqc4 x1rg5ohu x7phf20"><span aria-hidden="false" aria-label=" Entregue "><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" class="" fill="currentColor"><title>wds-ic-read</title><path fill="currentColor" d="M14.73 6.01a1 1 0 0 1 1.41-.15l.01.01a1 1 0 0 1 .15 1.41L7.6 18.01a1 1 0 0 1-.73.37h-.05c-.26 0-.52-.11-.71-.3l-4.03-4.09a.99.99 0 0 1 0-1.41.99.99 0 0 1 1.41 0l3.25 3.29 7.99-9.86Zm5.71.12a1 1 0 0 1 1.41-.15h-.01a1 1 0 0 1 .15 1.41l-8.41 10.45a1 1 0 0 1-.73.37h-.05a1 1 0 0 1-.71-.3l-1.36-1.26a.55.55 0 0 1-.02-.81l.56-.68c.21-.2.53-.21.75-.03l.71.58 7.71-9.58Z"></path></svg></span></div></div></div></div></div><span class=""></span><div class="x10l6tqk xyc4j8s xceh6e4"></div></div></div><div class="x1c4vz4f xs83m0k xdl72j9 x1g77sc7 x78zum5 xozqiw3 x1oa3qoh x12fk4p8 xeuugli x2lwn1j x13a6bvl x1q0g3np x6s0dn4 xken49m xexx8yu x18d9i69 x135b78x x11lfxj5 x10l6tqk xwa60dl xfvs6mw xho9bl7"><div class="x1c4vz4f xs83m0k xdl72j9 x1g77sc7 xeuugli x2lwn1j xozqiw3 x1oa3qoh x12fk4p8 xexx8yu x1im30kd x18d9i69 x1djpfga xcxita6"><div></div></div></div></div><div class="x78zum5 xbfrwjf x8k05lb xeq5yr9 x1n2onr6 x1f889gz xpvyfi4" data-testid="addon-bubble-container"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div><div tabindex="-1" class="" role="row"><div tabindex="-1" class="x1n2onr6 xscbp6u" data-id="3EB0D64BEC9007C411841F" data-testid="conv-msg-3EB0D64BEC9007C411841F"><div class="x78zum5 xdt5ytf" data-virtualized="false"><div><div class="x78zum5 xdt5ytf x1hx0egp x1h3r9g6 x1ld4j5a xz2rn1k x5oh2r6 x13bx8za xgmf7it xcjqink xg7f59e xxfb629 x141l45o x1n33gsf xcp7ckg xzfsp05 xt5wqpu x1utqab1 x1ijczrz xqxqsie x10amw33 xuk3077 focusable-list-item x1klvx2g xahtqtb"><span class=""></span><div data-testid="msg-container" class="x1liijdw xu342n7 xelbjmh x16pgt24 x14ug900 x1c4vz4f x2lah0s xdl72j9 x12lqup9 x17fgdl5 x1n2onr6 x1qg1ob xxx6ivz x1gx27l9 x14fraq8 x2nxwck xb3dwbw"><div class="x1liijdw xu342n7 xelbjmh x16pgt24 x1n2onr6 x12xzxwr x1g5lz36 xgdw1sx false false"><div><span aria-label="Você:"></span><div><div class="x9f619 x1hx0egp x1yrsyyn xf159sx xwib8y2 x7coems"><div class="copyable-text" data-pre-plain-text="[09:38, 10/09/2026] Marcelo Xavier Travassos: "><div class="x1n2onr6 x1mzt3pk x126k92a x6ikm8r x10wlt62"><span data-testid="selectable-text" dir="ltr" class="x1f6kntn xjb2p0i x8r4c90 xo1l8bm x1ic7a3i x12xpedu xnpuxes selectable-text copyable-text" style="min-height: 0px;"><span class="x1lliihq">Orientação do Sr. Matheus, coordenador do <strong class="xnpuxes selectable-text copyable-text" data-testid="selectable-text" data-app-text-template="*${appText}*">SAME</strong> :
</span><span class="x1lliihq">
</span><span class="x1lliihq"><strong class="xnpuxes selectable-text copyable-text" data-testid="selectable-text" data-app-text-template="*${appText}*">A contaminação se dá por via sexual, por sangue e secreção. Apenas os cuidados padrões (luvas) que vcs já usam.</strong>
</span><span class="x1lliihq">
</span><span class="">Pedi a ele que nos enviasse uma <strong class="xnpuxes selectable-text copyable-text" data-testid="selectable-text" data-app-text-template="*${appText}*">cartilha</strong>, <strong class="xnpuxes selectable-text copyable-text" data-testid="selectable-text" data-app-text-template="*${appText}*">folder</strong>, <strong class="xnpuxes selectable-text copyable-text" data-testid="selectable-text" data-app-text-template="*${appText}*">prospecto</strong> etc, que trata desse assunto, a ser distribuído entre eles e nós, de acordo com ele esse material, já foi providenciado e está aguardando a gráfica entregar, assim que acontecer ele entrará em contato conosco.</span></span><span class=""><span class="x3nfvp2 xxymvpz xlshs6z xqtp20y xexx8yu x1uc92m x18d9i69 x181vq82 x12lo8hy x152skdk" aria-hidden="true"><span class="x1c4vz4f x2lah0s xn6xy2s"></span><span class="x1c4vz4f x2lah0s">09:38</span></span></span></div></div><div class="x1n2onr6 x1n327nk x18mqm2i xhsvlbd x14z9mp xz62fqu x1wbi8v6"><div class="x1bvqhpb xx3o462 xuxw1ft x78zum5 x6s0dn4 x12lo8hy x152skdk" data-testid="msg-meta" role="button"><span class="x1rg5ohu x16dsc37" dir="auto"><span class="x193iq5w xeuugli x13faqbe x1vvkbs xt0psk2 x1fj9vlw xhslqc4 x1hx0egp x1pg5gke xjb2p0i xo1l8bm xl2ypbo x1ic7a3i" style="--x-fontSize: 12px; --x-lineHeight: 8.5313px;">09:38</span></span><div class="xhslqc4 x1rg5ohu x7phf20"><span aria-hidden="false" aria-label=" Entregue "><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" class="" fill="currentColor"><title>wds-ic-read</title><path fill="currentColor" d="M14.73 6.01a1 1 0 0 1 1.41-.15l.01.01a1 1 0 0 1 .15 1.41L7.6 18.01a1 1 0 0 1-.73.37h-.05c-.26 0-.52-.11-.71-.3l-4.03-4.09a.99.99 0 0 1 0-1.41.99.99 0 0 1 1.41 0l3.25 3.29 7.99-9.86Zm5.71.12a1 1 0 0 1 1.41-.15h-.01a1 1 0 0 1 .15 1.41l-8.41 10.45a1 1 0 0 1-.73.37h-.05a1 1 0 0 1-.71-.3l-1.36-1.26a.55.55 0 0 1-.02-.81l.56-.68c.21-.2.53-.21.75-.03l.71.58 7.71-9.58Z"></path></svg></span></div